The Mandelbrot zoom of benchmarks/mandel, its GPU process spawned at the
host and mandel.c on the host's threads: each gives the iterations and
checksum of mandel.py, an independent program in Python, on small frames,
64 pixels square for 12 frames and an odd 51 for 30, the last 4096 times
narrower than the first, and mandel.py itself is checked against them.
Sequential, at -O0 and -O2, and with the loops on the host's threads at
-O2. The -O0 build has no --offload-arch, as life-sparse.test's.
REQUIRES: amdgpu-registered-target, libomp
RUN: merkc -O0 -fdo-loops -fprocess-declarations %libomp-flags %S/../../benchmarks/mandel/mandel.m -o %t0
RUN: merkc -O2 -fdo-loops -fprocess-declarations --offload-arch=gfx1030 %libomp-flags %S/../../benchmarks/mandel/mandel.m -o %t2
RUN: merkc -O2 -fopenmp -fdo-loops -fprocess-declarations --offload-arch=gfx1030 %libomp-flags %S/../../benchmarks/mandel/mandel.m -o %t.omp
RUN: clang -O2 -ffp-contract=off -fopenmp --offload-arch=gfx1030 %libomp-flags %S/../../benchmarks/mandel/mandel.c -o %t.c

RUN: %libomp-env MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 %t0 host | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=M,SMALL
RUN: %libomp-env MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 %t2 host | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=M,SMALL
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_NUM_THREADS=4 MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 %t.omp host | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=M,SMALL
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=DISABLED OMP_NUM_THREADS=4 MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 %t.c | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=C,SMALL
RUN: env MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 %python %S/../../benchmarks/mandel/mandel.py | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SMALL
M: Mandelbrot zoom, Mercury, GPU process
C: Mandelbrot zoom, C
SMALL: Iterations: 10601425
SMALL-NEXT: Checksum: 63198496

RUN: %libomp-env OMP_NUM_THREADS=4 MANDEL_SIZE=51 MANDEL_FRAMES=30 MANDEL_TRACE=1 %t.omp host | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ODD
RUN: %libomp-env MANDEL_SIZE=51 MANDEL_FRAMES=30 MANDEL_TRACE=1 %t2 host | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ODD
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=DISABLED OMP_NUM_THREADS=4 MANDEL_SIZE=51 MANDEL_FRAMES=30 MANDEL_TRACE=1 %t.c | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ODD
RUN: env MANDEL_SIZE=51 MANDEL_FRAMES=30 MANDEL_TRACE=1 %python %S/../../benchmarks/mandel/mandel.py | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ODD
ODD: frame 0: limit 256,
ODD: frame 29: limit 2112, 2793193 iterations
ODD-NEXT: Iterations: 44379424
ODD-NEXT: Checksum: 956766019

RUN: %libomp-env MANDEL_FRAMES=0 not %t2 host | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=USAGE
RUN: %libomp-env MANDEL_SIZE=1 not %t.c | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=USAGE
USAGE: MANDEL_SIZE must be at least 2 and MANDEL_FRAMES at least 1.
